## Third-party content

This project packages, and its built container images bake in, content from
two upstream OWASP projects. Both are licensed CC-BY-SA-4.0, verified via the
GitHub licence API on each upstream repository:

- OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS)
  https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS
  License: CC-BY-SA-4.0

- OWASP Cheat Sheet Series
  https://github.com/OWASP/CheatSheetSeries
  License: CC-BY-SA-4.0

Baking this content into a distributable image is redistribution, and the
SQLite index built from it — chunked, cross-linked, and re-served through the
MCP tools — is an adaptation under the Creative Commons framework. The index
therefore remains CC-BY-SA-4.0 in its own right; see LICENSE-DATA for the
full legal text of that license. The MIT license in LICENSE covers only the
project's own source code (the ingest pipeline, the MCP server, the plugin
and skills), never the upstream content or the index derived from it.

For the exact pinned version, release tag or commit SHA of each upstream
source in any given build, see `sources.lock.yml`, or call the `kb_info` MCP
tool against a running server — it reports the loaded pack versions directly
from the index that was actually built, which is the authoritative source
once an image has shipped.
